Hello <%= @resource.email %>,

You have been invited to join MakerLibrary3D.
<% if @resource.membership_plan.present? %>
Membership plan: <%= @resource.membership_plan.name %>
<% end %>
Accept your secure invitation:
<%= accept_invitation_url(@resource, invitation_token: @token) %>

